  "details": "I feel like the search UI for finding instances on worlds could use a little touch up, heres some ideas I wanna spitball:\n\n-Add a refresh button to refresh instances on a world\n\n-When clicking an instance lower on the scroll list for a world, it shifts the instance list back to the top. This makes it a little inconvient to search for lower population instances, as I have to scroll down each time I click on one lower in the list.\n\n-Some worlds have a lot of closed instances cluttering up the instance list, some fixes could be:\n\n1) Not showing closed instances\n\n2) Having a symbol (like the DND symbol) on the instance tab\n\n-Not all instances for a world are shown on the instance searcher. Some fixes could be:\n\n1) Making the instance searcher have rows and collums like world lists, thus being able to fit more on one page.\n\n2) Display all instances for the world",
